    "Data: CLIENT partition \u2192 staging table (INSERT APPEND) \u2192 EXCHANGE PARTITION \u2192 ARCHIVER target",
    "Row counts: PKG_AGENT_ARCHIVE.fn_get_row_count@AGENT_LINK compared with TARGET_ROW_COUNT",
], font_size=14)
